      "content": "i get that but my doctor is super hard to reach and i've been awake for like 20 hours straight. i've taken benadryl before just for allergies and it was fine. i'm not planning on taking a bunch of anything, just the normal dose of both. surely a little bit of benadryl isnt gonna do anything crazy if i'm just using it to sleep?",
